    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d8xv2tf",
      "content": "• Equator is the longest latitude."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qeqdvkv",
      "content": "• Prime Meridian is 0° longitude."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "orpr424",
      "content": "• Tropic of Cancer divides India into tropical and subtropical parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zspebuk",
      "content": "• India's standard meridian is 82°30′ E."
